  displayName:
    TranslatableName: IX-6315 Dawn
    plainText: 1
  description:
    TranslatableName: "From KSP1 & KSP2. I buffed its thrust by 25\u2013250x depending
      on version (stock KSP1's 0.2t is already weak; KSP2's 0.02t is unusable). Now
      it has very low thrust but extremely high Isp. Only useful for tiny probes
      doing interstellar or very long-duration missions.  "
    plainText: 1
